{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_110_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，王正月，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"二、邾人伐我南鄙，叔彭生帥師伐邾。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，乙亥，齊侯潘卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"四、六月，公會宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許伯、曹伯、晉趙盾。癸酉，同盟於新城。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同外楚也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，有星孛入於北斗。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"孛之為言猶茀也。其曰入北斗，斗有環域也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"六、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"七、晉人納捷菑於邾，弗克納。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"是郤克也，其曰人何也？微之也。何為微之也？長轂五百乘，綿地千里，過宋、鄭、滕、薛，敻入千乘之國，欲變人之主。至城下，然後知，何知之晚也。弗克納。未伐而曰弗克何也？弗克其義也。捷菑，晉出也。貜且，齊出也。貜且，正也。捷菑，不正也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"八、九月，甲申，公孫敖卒於齊。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"奔大夫不言卒，而言卒何也？為受其喪，不可不卒也。其地於外也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"九、齊公子商人弒其君舍。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"舍未踰年，其曰君何也？成舍之為君，所以重商人之弒也。商人其不以國氏何也？不以嫌代嫌也。舍之不日何也？未成為君也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"十、宋子哀來奔。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"其曰子哀，失之也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"十一、冬，單伯如齊。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"十二、齊人執單伯。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"私罪也。單伯淫於齊，齊人執之。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"十三、齊人執子叔姬。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_clt_110_21","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_110","textTraditional":"叔姬同罪也。","sentenceOrder":21}],"overrides":{}}